# Build tools for the release workflow's `build-sdk` job (2026-10-03).
# Compiled to requirements-build.txt with hashes:
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --allow-unsafe --output-file requirements-build.txt requirements-build.in
# The workflow installs ONLY from requirements-build.txt (`--require-hashes`) and
# builds with `python -m build --no-isolation`, so pyproject.toml's unpinned
# `[build-system] requires` is never resolved from the index at release time.
build
hatchling
